#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: quick_start_guide.xml:176
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Konfigurationsfil"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:177
msgid ""
"In this step, phpBB will automatically try to write the configuration file. "
"The forum needs the configuration to run properly. It contains all of the "
"database settings, so without it, phpBB will not be able to access the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"I dette trin forsøger phpBB automatisk at skrive konfigurationsfilen. "
"Forummet har brug for konfigurationen for at fungere korrekt. Den indeholder"
" alle databaseindstillingerne, så uden den kan phpBB ikke tilgå databasen."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:178
msgid ""
"Usually, automatically writing the configuration file works fine. But in "
"some cases it can fail due to wrong file permissions, for instance. In this "
"case, you need to upload the file manually. phpBB asks you to "
"<guilabel>download</guilabel> the config.php file and tells you what to do "
"with it. Please read the instructions carefully. After you have uploaded the"
" file, click <guilabel>Done</guilabel> to get to the last step. If "
"<guilabel>Done</guilabel> returns you to the same page as before, and does "
"not return a success message, you did not upload the file correctly."
msgstr ""
"Som regel virker automatisk skrivning af konfigurationsfilen fint. Men i "
"nogle tilfælde kan det fejle, f.eks. på grund af forkerte filtilladelser. I "
"så fald skal du uploade filen manuelt. phpBB beder dig "
"<guilabel>downloade</guilabel> filen config.php og fortæller dig, hvad du "
"skal gøre med den. Læs venligst instruktionerne omhyggeligt. Efter du har "
"uploadet filen, klik på <guilabel>Udført</guilabel> for at komme til sidste "
"trin. Fører <guilabel>Udført</guilabel> dig tilbage til samme side som før, "
"uden en succesbesked, har du ikke uploadet filen korrekt."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: quick_start_guide.xml:181
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Avancerede indstillinger"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:182
msgid ""
"The next several sections allow you to set some more advanced parameters of "
"the board configuration. They are optional, and you can always change them "
"later if you wish. So if you are unsure of what these settings mean, ignore "
"them and proceed to the final step to finish the installation."
msgstr ""
"De næste flere afsnit giver dig mulighed for at angive nogle mere avancerede"
" parametre for boardets konfiguration. De er valgfrie, og du kan altid ændre"
" dem senere, hvis du ønsker det. Er du usikker på hvad disse indstillinger "
"betyder, kan du ignorere dem og fortsætte til det sidste trin for at "
"afslutte installationen."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: quick_start_guide.xml:185
msgid "Final Steps"
msgstr "Sidste trin"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:186
msgid ""
"At the end of the installation, you can set the default language of your "
"board, a title for your board, and a short description of it. In a vanilla "
"(basic) phpBB 3.3 installation we only include <guilabel>English "
"[GB]</guilabel>. You can download further languages from <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/languages/\">www.phpbb.com</ulink>, and add them"
" later."
msgstr ""
"I slutningen af installationen kan du angive standardsproget for dit board, "
"en titel til boardet samt en kort beskrivelse af det. I en almindelig "
"(grundlæggende) installation af phpBB 3.3 medfølger kun <guilabel>English "
"[GB]</guilabel>. Du kan downloade flere sprog fra <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/languages/\">www.phpbb.com</ulink> og tilføje "
"dem senere."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:187
