#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:270
msgid ""
"Forums are the sections where topics are stored. Without forums, your users "
"would have nowhere to post! Creating forums is very easy."
msgstr ""
"Fora er de sektioner, hvor emner gemmes. Uden fora ville dine brugere ikke "
"have noget sted at skrive indlæg! Det er meget nemt at oprette fora."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:271
msgid ""
"Firstly, make sure you are logged in. Find the <guilabel>[ Administration "
"Control Panel ]</guilabel> link at the bottom of the page, and click it. You"
" should be in the Administration Index. You can administer your board here."
msgstr ""
"Sørg først for at du er logget ind. Find linket <guilabel>[ "
"Administratorkontrolpanel ]</guilabel> nederst på siden, og klik på det. Du "
"bør nu være på administratorindekset. Her kan du administrere dit board."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:272
msgid ""
"There are tabs at the top for the Administration Control Panel that will "
"guide you to each category. You must get to the Forum Administration section"
" to create a forum, so click the <guilabel>Forums</guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""
"Der er faner øverst i administratorkontrolpanelet, som guider dig til hver "
"kategori. Du skal gå til sektionen Forumadministration for at oprette et "
"forum, så klik på fanen <guilabel>Fora</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:273
msgid ""
"The Forum Administration Index is where you can manage forums on your site. "
"Along with being able to create forums, you are also able to create "
"subforums. Subforums are forums that are located in a parent forum in a "
"hierachy. For more information about subforums, see the <link "
"linkend=\"acp_forums_subforums\">administration guide on subforums</link>."
msgstr ""
"Forumadministrationsindekset er hvor du kan administrere fora på dit site. "
"Ud over at kunne oprette fora, kan du også oprette underfora. Underfora er "
"fora, der er placeret i et overordnet forum i et hierarki. For mere "
"information om underfora, se <link "
"linkend=\"acp_forums_subforums\">administratorvejledningen om "
"underfora</link>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:274
msgid ""
"Find the <guilabel>Create new forum</guilabel> button on the right side of "
"the page. Type in the name of the forum you wish in the textbox located "
"directly to the left of this button. For example, if the forum name was to "
