#. (itstool) path: caption/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:283
msgid "Here you can choose the name and the description of your a new forum."
msgstr "Her kan du vælge navnet og beskrivelsen af dit nye forum."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:287
msgid ""
"The default settings are usually good enough to get your new forum up and "
"running; however, you may change them to suit your needs. But there are "
"three key forum settings that you should pay attention to. The Parent Forum "
"setting allows you to choose which forum your new forum will belong to. Be "
"careful to what level you want your forum to be in. (The Parent Forum "
"setting is important when creating subforums. For more information on "
"subforums, continue reading to the section on creating subforums) The \"Copy"
" Permissions\" setting allows you to copy the permissions from an existing "
"forum to your new forum. Use this if you want to keep permissions constant. "
"The forum style setting allows you to set which style your new forum will "
"display. Your new forum can show a different style to another. For more "
"information on each forum setting, see the <xref linkend=\"acp_forums\">in-"
"depth section on forum creation</xref>"
msgstr ""
"Standardindstillingerne er som regel gode nok til at få dit nye forum op at "
"køre; du kan dog ændre dem, så de passer til dine behov. Men der er tre "
"vigtige forumindstillinger, du bør være opmærksom på. Indstillingen "
"Overordnet forum giver dig mulighed for at vælge, hvilket forum dit nye "
"forum skal høre til. Vær omhyggelig med, hvilket niveau du ønsker dit forum "
"skal have. (Indstillingen Overordnet forum er vigtig, når du opretter "
"underfora. For mere information om underfora, fortsæt med at læse afsnittet "
"om oprettelse af underfora) Indstillingen \"Kopiér tilladelser\" giver dig "
"mulighed for at kopiere tilladelserne fra et eksisterende forum til dit nye "
"forum. Brug dette, hvis du ønsker at holde tilladelserne konstante. "
"Indstillingen forumtypografi giver dig mulighed for at angive, hvilken "
"typografi dit nye forum skal vise. Dit nye forum kan vise en anden typografi"
" end et andet. For mere information om hver forumindstilling, se <xref "
"linkend=\"acp_forums\">det dybdegående afsnit om oprettelse af fora</xref>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:288
msgid ""
"Once you're done configuring the settings of your new forum, scroll to the "
"bottom of the page and click the <guilabel>Submit</guilabel> button to "
"create your forum and it's settings. If your new forum was created "
"successfully, the screen will show you a success message."
msgstr ""
"Når du er færdig med at konfigurere indstillingerne for dit nye forum, rul "
"til bunden af siden, og klik på knappen <guilabel>Send</guilabel> for at "
"oprette dit forum med dets indstillinger. Blev dit nye forum oprettet med "
"succes, vises der en succesbesked på skærmen."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:289
msgid ""
"If you wish to set permissions for the forum (or if you do not click on "
"anything), you will see the forum permissions screen. If you do not want to "
"(and want to use the default permissions for your new forum), click on the "
"<guilabel>Back to previous page</guilabel> link. Otherwise, continue and set"
