#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:336
msgid ""
"On the other hand local permissions do only apply to specific forums. So if "
"you disallow someone to post in one forum, for instance, it will not impact "
"the rest of the board. The user will still be able to post in any other "
"forum he has the local permission to post."
msgstr ""
"Lokale tilladelser gælder derimod kun for specifikke fora. Forhindrer du "
"f.eks. nogen i at skrive indlæg i ét forum, påvirker det ikke resten af "
"boardet. Brugeren kan stadig skrive indlæg i ethvert andet forum, "
"vedkommende har lokal tilladelse til at skrive indlæg i."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:337
msgid ""
"You can appoint moderators either globally or locally. If you trust some of "
"your users enough, you can make them Global Moderators. They can moderate "
"all forums they have access to with the permissions you assign to them. "
"Compared to that, local moderators will only be able to moderate the number "
"of forums you select for them. They can also have different moderator "
"permissions for different forums. While they are able to delete topics in "
"one forum, they may not be allowed to do it in another. Global moderators "
"will have the same permissions for all forums."
msgstr ""
"Du kan udpege redaktører enten globalt eller lokalt. Stoler du nok på nogle "
"af dine brugere, kan du gøre dem til globale redaktører. De kan moderere "
"alle fora, de har adgang til, med de tilladelser du tildeler dem. Til "
"sammenligning kan lokale redaktører kun moderere det antal fora, du vælger "
"til dem. De kan også have forskellige redaktørtilladelser for forskellige "
"fora. Mens de kan slette emner i ét forum, må de måske ikke gøre det i et "
"andet. Globale redaktører har de samme tilladelser for alle fora."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: quick_start_guide.xml:340
msgid "Setting forum permissions"
msgstr "Angivelse af forumtilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:341
msgid ""
"To set the permissions for your new forum we need the local <guilabel>Forum "
"Based Permissions</guilabel>. First you have to decide how you want to set "
"the permissions. If you want to set them for a single group or user, you "
"should use the <guilabel>Group</guilabel> or <guilabel>User Forum "
"Permissions</guilabel>. They will allow you to select one group or user, and"
" then select the forums you want to set the permissions for."
msgstr ""
"For at angive tilladelserne for dit nye forum, har vi brug for de lokale "
"<guilabel>Forumbaserede tilladelser</guilabel>. Først skal du beslutte, "
"hvordan du vil angive tilladelserne. Ønsker du at angive dem for en enkelt "
"gruppe eller bruger, bør du bruge <guilabel>Gruppe</guilabel> eller "
"<guilabel>Brugerens forumtilladelser</guilabel>. De giver dig mulighed for "
"at vælge én gruppe eller bruger, og derefter vælge de fora, du vil angive "
"tilladelser for."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:342
msgid ""
"But for this Quick Start Guide we will concentrate on the <guilabel>Forum "
"Permissions</guilabel>. Instead of selecting a user or group, you select the"
" forums you want to change first. You can select them either by selecting "
"the forums manually in the top list, or by single forum and single forum "
"plus subforums respectively in the lower pull down menus. "
"<guilabel>Submit</guilabel> will bring you to the next page."
msgstr ""
"Men til denne hurtigstartvejledning koncentrerer vi os om "
"<guilabel>Forumtilladelser</guilabel>. I stedet for at vælge en bruger eller"
" gruppe, vælger du først de fora, du vil ændre. Du kan vælge dem enten ved "
"at vælge foraene manuelt i den øverste liste, eller via henholdsvis enkelt "
"forum og enkelt forum plus underfora i dropdownmenuerne nedenfor. "
"<guilabel>Send</guilabel> fører dig til næste side."

