#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: quick_start_guide.xml:387
msgid "Permissions roles"
msgstr "Tilladelsesroller"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:388
msgid ""
"phpBB 3.3 Proteus ships with a number of default permission roles, that "
"offer you a wide variety of options for setting permissions. Instead of "
"having to check each radio button manually, you can select a predefined role"
" in the <guilabel>Role</guilabel>pull down list. Each role has a detailed "
"description, that will pop up when you hover your mouse over it. Submit your"
" changes with <guilabel>Apply Permissions</guilabel> or <guilabel>Apply All "
"Permissions</guilabel> when you are satisfied with them. That will set the "
"permissions and you are done."
msgstr ""
"phpBB 3.3 Proteus leveres med en række standardtilladelsesroller, der "
"tilbyder dig en bred vifte af muligheder for at angive tilladelser. I stedet"
" for manuelt at skulle markere hver radioknap, kan du vælge en "
"foruddefineret rolle i dropdownmenuen <guilabel>Rolle</guilabel>. Hver rolle"
" har en detaljeret beskrivelse, som vises når du holder musen over den. "
"Indsend dine ændringer med <guilabel>Anvend tilladelser</guilabel> eller "
"<guilabel>Anvend alle tilladelser</guilabel>, når du er tilfreds med dem. "
"Det angiver tilladelserne, og du er færdig."

