#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:452
msgid ""
"When you're done simply hit <guilabel>Apply all Permissions</guilabel>. All "
"the permissions mentioned here can also be selected from the right side of "
"the form to give you more granular options."
msgstr ""
"Når du er færdig, tryk blot på <guilabel>Anvend alle tilladelser</guilabel>."
" Alle de her nævnte tilladelser kan også vælges fra højre side af formularen"
" for mere detaljerede muligheder."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: quick_start_guide.xml:463
msgid "Setting global permissions"
msgstr "Angivelse af globale tilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:464
msgid ""
"Local Permissions are too local for you? Well, then phpBB3 has something to "
"offer for you, too: Global Permissions:"
msgstr ""
"Er lokale tilladelser for lokale til dig? Så har phpBB3 også noget at "
"tilbyde dig: Globale tilladelser:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:466
msgid "Users Permissions"
msgstr "Brugertilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:467
msgid "Groups Permissions"
msgstr "Gruppetilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:468
msgid "Administrators"
msgstr "Administratorer"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:469
msgid "Global Moderators"
msgstr "Globale redaktører"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:471
msgid ""
"In \"User Permissions\" and \"Group Permissions\" you can allow and disallow"
" features like attachments, signatures and avatars for specific users and "
"user groups. Note that some of these settings only matter if the respective "
"feature is enabled in the \"Board Features\" (see <xref "
"linkend=\"quick_settings_boardfeatures\"/> for details)."
msgstr ""
"I \"Brugertilladelser\" og \"Gruppetilladelser\" kan du tillade og forbyde "
"funktioner som vedhæftede filer, signaturer og avatarer for specifikke "
"brugere og brugergrupper. Bemærk at nogle af disse indstillinger kun betyder"
" noget, hvis den pågældende funktion er aktiveret under \"Boardfunktioner\" "
"(se <xref linkend=\"quick_settings_boardfeatures\"/> for detaljer)."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:472
msgid ""
"Under \"Administrators\" you can give users or groups administrator "
"privileges like the ability to manage forums or change user permissions. For"
" details on these settings please read the <xref "
"linkend=\"acp_permissions\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Under \"Administratorer\" kan du give brugere eller grupper "
"administratorrettigheder, såsom muligheden for at administrere fora eller "
"ændre brugertilladelser. For detaljer om disse indstillinger, læs venligst "
"<xref linkend=\"acp_permissions\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:473
msgid ""
"The \"Global Moderators\" form offers you the same settings as the forum "
"specific form (described in <xref "
"linkend=\"quick_permissions_moderators\"/>) but applies to all forums on "
"your board."
msgstr ""
"Formularen \"Globale redaktører\" tilbyder dig de samme indstillinger som "
"den forumspecifikke formular (beskrevet i <xref "
"linkend=\"quick_permissions_moderators\"/>), men gælder for alle fora på dit"
" board."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: quick_start_guide.xml:478
msgid "Obtaining support"
msgstr "Få support"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:479
msgid ""
"The <ulink url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/about/\">phpBB Team</ulink> provides "
"many options for users to find support for their phpBB install. In addition "
"to this very documentation, the <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/community/viewforum.php?f=556\">support forum on"
" www.phpbb.com</ulink> has many answers that users like you are searching "
"for. Therefore, we highly recommend the use of the search feature before "
"asking a new question. If you are unable to find an answer, feel free to "
"post a new topic asking for help. Be sure to be descriptive when explaining "
"your problem! The more we know about what is happening, the faster we can "
"provide you with the answer you are looking for. Be sure to fill out the "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/support/srt/\">Support Request "
"Template</ulink> with the information it asks for and provide it in your "
"post."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/about/\">phpBB-teamet</ulink> tilbyder "
"mange muligheder for brugere til at finde support til deres phpBB-"
"installation. Ud over selve denne dokumentation har <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/community/viewforum.php?f=556\">supportforummet "
"på www.phpbb.com</ulink> mange svar, som brugere som dig leder efter. Vi "
"anbefaler derfor kraftigt at bruge søgefunktionen, før du stiller et nyt "
"spørgsmål. Kan du ikke finde et svar, er du velkommen til at oprette et nyt "
"emne og bede om hjælp. Sørg for at være beskrivende, når du forklarer dit "
"problem! Jo mere vi ved om hvad der sker, desto hurtigere kan vi give dig "
"det svar, du leder efter. Sørg for at udfylde <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/support/srt/\">supportanmodningsskabelonen</ulink>"
" med de oplysninger, den beder om, og angiv den i dit indlæg."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:481
msgid ""
"In addition to the support forum on www.phpbb.com, we provide a <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/kb/\">Knowledge Base</ulink> for users to read "
"and submit articles on common answers to questions. Our community has taken "
"a lot of time in writing these articles, so be sure to check them out."
msgstr ""
"Ud over supportforummet på www.phpbb.com tilbyder vi en <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/kb/\">vidensbase</ulink>, hvor brugere kan læse "
"og indsende artikler om almindelige svar på spørgsmål. Vores community har "
"brugt meget tid på at skrive disse artikler, så sørg for at tjekke dem ud."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:483
msgid ""
"We provide realtime support in <ulink "
"url=\"irc://irc.phpbb.com/phpbb\">#phpBB</ulink> on the popular Open Source "
"IRC network, <ulink url=\"http://www.freenode.net/\">Freenode</ulink>. You "
"can typically find someone from each of the teams in here, as well as fellow"
" users who are more than happy to help you out. Be sure to read the <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/support/irc/\">IRC rules</ulink> before joining "
"the channel, as we have a few basic netiquette rules that we ask users to "
"follow. At any given time, there can be as many as 60 users, if not more in "
"the channel, so you are almost certain to find someone there to help you. "
"However, it is important that you read and follow the IRC rules as people "
"may not answer you. An example of this is that oftentimes users come in to "
"the channel and ask if anybody is around and then end up leaving 30 seconds "
"later before someone has the chance to answer. Instead, be sure to ask your "
"question and wait. As the saying goes, \"don't ask to ask, just ask!\""
msgstr ""
"Vi tilbyder realtidssupport i <ulink "
"url=\"irc://irc.phpbb.com/phpbb\">#phpBB</ulink> på det populære open "
"source-IRC-netværk, <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.freenode.net/\">Freenode</ulink>. Du kan typisk finde nogen"
" fra hvert af teamene her, samt medbrugere der mere end gerne hjælper dig. "
"Sørg for at læse <ulink url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/support/irc/\">IRC-"
"reglerne</ulink>, før du går ind i kanalen, da vi har nogle grundlæggende "
"netikette-regler, vi beder brugere følge. På et givent tidspunkt kan der "
"være helt op til 60 brugere, hvis ikke flere, i kanalen, så du er næsten "
"sikker på at finde nogen der til at hjælpe dig. Det er dog vigtigt, at du "
"læser og følger IRC-reglerne, da folk måske ikke svarer dig. Et eksempel på "
"dette er, at brugere ofte kommer ind i kanalen og spørger om nogen er til "
"stede, for derefter at forlade kanalen 30 sekunder senere, før nogen har "
"haft mulighed for at svare. Sørg i stedet for at stille dit spørgsmål og "
"vente. Som man siger: \"spørg ikke om du må spørge, spørg bare!\""

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: quick_start_guide.xml:485
msgid ""
"English is not your native language? Not a problem! We also provide an "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/support/intl/\">International Support "
"page</ulink> with links to various websites that provide support in Espanol,"
" Deutsch, Francais, and more."
msgstr ""
"Er engelsk ikke dit modersmål? Ikke noget problem! Vi tilbyder også en "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/support/intl/\">international "
"supportside</ulink> med links til forskellige websites, der tilbyder support"
" på spansk, tysk, fransk og mere."
